    \ Aletheia I | 583 | 0.4530 | 0.287 | 0.000 | 0.243 | 0.629 | 0.698 | 0.613 | 0.330 | 0.991 | 0.030 | 0.708 |\n| 889 | 1 | Aletheia I - Scanpy Combat Baseline (PCA 100) | Aletheia I | 581 | 0.6163 | 0.596 | 0.748 | 0.207 | 0.239 | 0.908 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.984 | 0.109 | 0.685 |\n| 886 | 1 | Aletheia I - Scanpy Combat Baseline | Aletheia I | 579 | 0.5941 | 0.591 | 0.676 | 0.223 | 0.294 | 0.878 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.057 | 0.543 |\n| 885 | 1 | Aletheia I - Mean Center PCA Baseline | Aletheia I | 578 | 0.5716 | 0.457 | 0.640 | 0.220 | 0.303 | 0.876 | 0.665 | 1.000 | 0.989 | 0.012 | 0.553 |\n| 2 | 1 | Combat Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.5895 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.603 |\n| 1 | 1 | BBKNN Manual Baseline | System | 0 | 0.4138 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.917 | 0.694 | 0.000 | 0.904 | 0.886 | 0.000 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\
