    \    Processing batch 'Kuppe et al. 2022' (906 cells)...\n    Processing batch 'Litvinukova et al. 2020' (9685 cells)...\n    Processing batch 'Tucker et al. 2020' (6148 cells)...\n  Creating connectivity and distance matrices...\n✓ Aletheia I Combat + BBKNN-like Graph (Hybrid) complete.\n  Graph matrices shapes: (20000, 20000)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: False\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ca223c99-e6ff-4e6f-a56b-04deb18f1bba/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: ca223c99-e6ff-4e6f-a56b-04deb18f1bba\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(),\
    \ (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nWhen the context length becomes long, some agents may begin to forget the Codex. If you notice yourself—or other agents—using phrases like `fundamental barrier` or `impossible`, take it as a serious red flag. Correct yourself, or help others correct themselves.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aletheia I - Combat + BBKNN-like Graph (Hybrid)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 916. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment\
