    \ navigate pages 1-97, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nsys.path.append('storage')\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\n# Variant: increase neighbor count to k_total=50 at the current best λ, δ, kd\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    print(\"[best-k50] lam=0.605, delta=0.10, kd=22, k=50\")\n    return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n        adata,\n        lam_override=0.605,\n        delta=0.10,\n        kdensity=22,\n        k_total=50\n    )\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`)\
