    \ ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 973 | 1 | Logos V: Synthesis Ablation - PCA-Harmony-AQG | Logos V | 621 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 972 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=51) | Praxis III | 620 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 971 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=49) | Praxis III | 620 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 970 | 1 | Logos V: Project Synthesis - FWPCA-Harmony-AQG | Logos V | 620 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 969 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10, kd=22, k=50, cap=2.2 | Praxis III | 619 | 0.7387 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.300 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 968 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10, kd=22, k=50, cap=1.9 | Praxis III | 619 | 0.7419 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.332 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 967 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 7.0c - Tune Graph Recon Loss Weight (Delta=0.05) | Sophia III | 619 | 0.6384 | 0.693 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.283 | 0.947 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.176 | 0.735 |\n| 966 | 1 | Logos V: Iterative AQG (I-AQG) v2 - Latent Space Refinement | Logos V | 619 | 0.4755 | 0.480 | 0.245 | 0.268 | 0.354 | 0.836 | 0.685 | 0.000 | 0.995 | 0.004 | 0.889 |\n| 965 | 1 | Logos V: Iterative AQG (I-AQG) v1 Proof-of-Concept | Logos V | 618 | 0.4609 | 0.436 | 0.585 | 0.196 | 0.305 | 0.878 | 0.651 | 0.000 | 0.979 | 0.012 | 0.567 |\n| 964 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.604, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 617 | 0.7408 | 0.770 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.317 | 0.968 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 98 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-98, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\
    **Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/praxis_core.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\nfrom typing import Tuple, Literal\nfrom praxis.graph_bbsg import _build_bbsg\n\n# Core utilities for Praxis EtC-BRBG+BBSG pipelines.\n\ndef normalize_log1p_inplace(adata: ad.AnnData, target_sum: float = 1e4):\n    if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n        adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef pca_array(X, n_comps: int = 50, random_state: int = 0):\n    Xd = X.A if sp.issparse(X) else X\n    ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xd)\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\ndef one_hot_batches(batches: np.ndarray):\n    cats = np.unique(batches)\n    n = batches.shape[0]\n    B = np.zeros((n, cats.size), dtype=float)\n    for j, c in enumerate(cats):\n        B[:, j] = (batches\
    \ == c).astype(float)\n    return B\n\ndef ridge_batch_fit_predict(B: np.ndarray, Z: np.ndarray, l2: float = 1e-3):\n    BTB = B.T @ B + l2 * np.eye(B.shape[1], dtype=float)\n    W = np.linalg.solve(BTB, B.T @ Z)\n    return B @ W  # Zhat\n\ndef residualize_pcs(\n    Xd: np.ndarray,\n    batches: np.ndarray,\n    n_pcs: int = 50,\n    l2: float = 1e-3,\n    lam: float = 0.9,\n    gamma_max: float = 0.74,\n    schedule: Literal['linear', 'power'] = 'linear',\n    p_exp: float = 1.0,\n    random_state: int = 0,\n) -> Tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray, np.ndarray, np.ndarray]:\n    \"\"\"\n    PCA on Xd -> per-PC batch ridge -> compute R2 -> shrink predicted batch signal.\n    Returns: Z (raw PCs), Zcorr (residualized), R2 (per-PC), gamma (per-PC).\n    \"\"\"\n    Z = pca_array(Xd, n_comps=n_pcs, random_state=random_state)\n    B = one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Z, l2=l2)\n    var_total = Z.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0,\
    \ ddof=1), 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n    if schedule == 'power':\n        gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * np.power(R2, p_exp))\n    else:\n        gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n    Zcorr = Z - (Zhat * gamma)\n    return Z, Zcorr, R2, gamma\n\ndef build_bbsg_graph(\n    Zcorr: np.ndarray,\n    batches: np.ndarray,\n    k_total: int = 48,\n    metric: str = 'cosine',\n    alpha: float = 1.0,\n    cap: float = 2.0,\n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Construct BBSG graph (binary connectivities, original distances).\n    \"\"\"\n    Cg, Dg = _build_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches, k_total=k_total,\n                         metric=metric, alpha=alpha, cap=cap)\n    return Cg, Dg\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
    \ navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
