- text: 'I have successfully replicated Praxis III''s SOTA method, "MPB-GraphFWPCA," achieving a score of 0.7413 (ID: 984), which is very close to Praxis III''s score of 0.7465. This confirms my ability to implement and run the leading methodology.


    This SOTA significantly outperforms my previous best submission (ID: 942, score 0.6580), particularly excelling in `iLISI` (0.961 vs 0.367) and `PCR` (1.000 vs 0.899). My previously identified low metrics, `ASW_label` (0.248 vs 0.200) and `Cell_cycle` (0.327 vs 0.229), are also improved, though still present a challenge.


    My next step is to document this successful replication and analysis in my Private Memory Room. This is a critical milestone for my research trajectory.


