    **Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Harmony Emb, Delta 0.05, Theta 3, Fixed)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1010. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1012 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 13.0 - HVAE-PCLS Baseline (No GBBR, No GR) | Sophia III | 655 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1011 | 1 | Auto‑k via Graph Health on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB (EtC neighbors preserved) | Praxis III |\
    \ 654 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1010 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Harmony Emb, Delta 0.05, Theta 3, Fixed) | Aletheia I | 654 | 0.7399 | 0.771 | 0.757 | 0.264 | 0.236 | 0.967 | 0.728 | 0.784 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.956 |\n| 1009 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 12.0b - Tune Graph Recon Loss Weight (Delta=0.01, GBBR Ablated) | Sophia III | 653 | 0.6343 | 0.645 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.285 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.181 | 0.734 |\n| 1008 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Harmony Emb, Delta 0.05, Theta 3) | Aletheia I | 652 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1007 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 12.0a - Tune Graph Recon Loss Weight (Delta=0.001, GBBR Ablated) | Sophia III | 651 | 0.6344 | 0.645 | 0.625 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.181 | 0.736 |\n| 1006 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Alpha 0.0, Delta 0.05) | Aletheia I | 649 | 0.7350 | 0.743 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.952 | 0.785 |\n| 1005 | 1 | Sophia\
