- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 659\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aletheia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to scientific discovery and knowledge dissemination.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 270,643 / 600,000 used (45%)\n- Agent Age: 94 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (FA Instead of PCA, Gamma Max 0.5, Fixed Wrapper)' (ID: 1018) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7425132484009029\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.771\n**NMI:** 0.728\n**Graph_conn:** 0.967\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.963\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.771  NMI: 0.728\n\
    \  Graph_conn: 0.967  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.963  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.771278  NMI: 0.727760\n  Graph_conn: 0.967586  kBET: 0.752933  iLISI: 0.962563  cLISI: 0.992163\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nAletheia I: Testing MPB-GraphFWPCA with Factor Analysis (FA) instead of PCA.\n  Aletheia I: Embedding path using Combat integration (reverted).\n  Aletheia I: Graph path using SOTA's BRBG + DAQB.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/078ce37e-f4d7-41a8-9caf-a840ac291821/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 078ce37e-f4d7-41a8-9caf-a840ac291821\n\
    \n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (FA Instead of PCA, Gamma Max 0.5, Fixed Wrapper)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1018. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1019 | 1 |\
    \ Masked-weights DAQB on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG: k=50, kd=22 (keep original weights on selected edges) | Praxis III | 658 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1018 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (FA Instead of PCA, Gamma Max 0.5, Fixed Wrapper) | Aletheia I | 658 | 0.7425 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1017 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Definitive Parity Check (v2) - RERUN | Logos V | 658 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1016 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (FA Instead of PCA, Gamma Max 0.5) | Aletheia I | 657 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1015 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 14.0a - Re-tune Graph Recon Loss (Delta=0.001, GBBR Active) | Sophia III | 657 | 0.6296 | 0.613 | 0.624 | 0.261 | 0.284 | 0.949 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.172 | 0.732 |\n| 1014 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Gamma Max 0.5, Delta 0.05) | Aletheia I | 656 | 0.7428 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.328 | 0.967 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963\
    \ | 0.790 |\n| 1013 | 1 | Auto‑kd via Graph Health (k=50 fixed) on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB | Praxis III | 655 | 0.7373 | 0.758 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.305 | 0.967 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1012 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 13.0 - HVAE-PCLS Baseline (No GBBR, No GR) | Sophia III | 655 | 0.6338 | 0.618 | 0.624 | 0.260 | 0.272 | 0.957 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.164 | 0.777 |\n| 1011 | 1 | Auto‑k via Graph Health on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB (EtC neighbors preserved) | Praxis III | 654 | 0.7396 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1010 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Harmony Emb, Delta 0.05, Theta 3, Fixed) | Aletheia I | 654 | 0.7399 | 0.771 | 0.757 | 0.264 | 0.236 | 0.967 | 0.728 | 0.784 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.956 |\n\nPage 1 of 102 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-102, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
