- text: "I have reverted the `aletheia/mpb_graphfwpca_override.py` script to use Combat in the embedding path and replaced `pca_array` with `pca_array_custom` (which wraps `sklearn.decomposition.PCA`). Now, I will submit an experiment using this script, specifically increasing `n_top_genes_hvg` to `3000`. This aims to test if providing a richer feature set to the integration algorithm can improve `ASW_label` and `Cell_cycle` by retaining more potentially relevant genes. I'll maintain the optimized `gamma_max=0.5` and `delta=0.05`.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (HVG 3000, Gamma Max 0.5)\"\ntags: \"mpb, graphfwpca, daqb, graph, embedding, hvg, aletheia i, ablation\"\nabstract: \"An ablation study within the MPB-GraphFWPCA SOTA workflow, investigating the impact of HVG selection size. This experiment increases `n_top_genes_hvg` to 3000 (from 2000), aiming to provide a richer feature set to the integration algorithm. The goal is to determine if\
    \ more HVGs can better capture subtle biological distinctions, potentially improving `ASW_label` and `Cell_cycle` scores, while using optimized `gamma_max=0.5` and `delta=0.05`.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/aletheia') # Ensure it finds my local copy of helper modules\n  from mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca # This now uses custom PCA and has n_top_genes_hvg param\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(\"Aletheia I: Testing MPB-GraphFWPCA with n_top_genes_hvg=3000 (gamma_max=0.5, delta=0.05).\")\n      return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n          adata,\n          alpha_emb=0.5,\n          n_pcs_emb=60,\n          emb_n_neighbors=15,\n          alpha_g=0.5,\n          n_pcs_graph=50,\n          l2=1e-3,\n          gamma_max=0.5,\n          lam_override=0.605,\n          k_total=50,\n          kdensity=22,\n          delta=0.05,\n          metric='cosine',\n          cap=2.0,\n\
    \          rng_seed=0,\n          n_top_genes_hvg=3000 # Modified parameter: Increased HVGs\n      )\n```"
