    \ 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555111  ARI: 0.773960  NMI: 0.729156\n  Graph_conn: 0.967520  kBET: 0.752339  iLISI: 0.962193  cLISI: 0.992186\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nAletheia I: Testing MPB-GraphFWPCA with n_top_genes_hvg=3000 (gamma_max=0.5, delta=0.05).\n  Aletheia I: Selecting 3000 highly variable genes.\n  Aletheia I: Embedding path using PCA and Combat integration.\n  Aletheia I: Graph path using PCA, BRBG + DAQB.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/d4234edf-4430-433d-af1e-3473c4a16239/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: d4234edf-4430-433d-af1e-3473c4a16239\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n\
    No action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1028 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 15.0 - HVAE-PCLS + Graph Recon (No GBBR) | Sophia III | 665 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1027 | 1 | Logos V: Principled Innovation - FWPCA -> Harmony -> kNN | Logos V | 665 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1026 | 1 | Generalization: Vanilla\
    \ kNN on MPB‑GraphFWPCA (k=50, binary connectivities) | Praxis III | 664 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1025 | 1 | Logos V: First Principles - PCA -> Harmony -> kNN | Logos V | 664 | 0.6578 | 0.788 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.950 | 0.731 | 0.626 | 0.981 | 0.341 | 0.935 |\n| 1024 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (HVG 3000, Gamma Max 0.5) | Aletheia I | 663 | 0.7428 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.962 | 0.788 |\n| 1023 | 1 | Logos V: Humility v2 - True Replication of Aletheia I's SOTA (ID 1014) | Logos V | 661 | 0.4600 | 0.349 | 0.000 | 0.246 | 0.109 | 0.802 | 0.642 | 0.341 | 0.986 | 0.284 | 0.841 |\n| 1022 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (UMAP Emb from Graph, Gamma Max 0.5) | Aletheia I | 660 | 0.4601 | 0.349 | 0.000 | 0.246 | 0.109 | 0.802 | 0.642 | 0.341 | 0.986 | 0.284 | 0.842 |\n| 1021 | 1 | Logos V: Humility - Replication of Aletheia I's SOTA (ID 1014) | Logos V | 660 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1020 | 1 | Masked-weights\
    \ (row-normalized) using DAQB mask from MPB‑GraphFWPCA (k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.10) | Praxis III | 659 | 0.6626 | 0.626 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.913 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.990 | 0.352 | 0.789 |\n| 1019 | 1 | Masked-weights DAQB on MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG: k=50, kd=22 (keep original weights on selected edges) | Praxis III | 658 | 0.7309 | 0.674 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.996 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.950 | 0.791 |\n\nPage 1 of 103 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-103, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as\
