    \ SCGA-ABI Exp 20.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Vanilla GR, Single-Phase) | Sophia III | 687 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1061 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperpar... | Sophia III | 685 | 0.6306 | 0.612 | 0.645 | 0.272 | 0.245 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.170 | 0.735 |\n| 1060 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 19.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent, Tuned GR Hyperpar... | Sophia III | 684 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1059 | 1 | Sophia III: SCGA-ABI Exp 18.0 - HVAE-PCLS + GR (Target from Post-Combat Latent) - FINAL INDENTATI... | Sophia III | 682 | 0.6305 | 0.612 | 0.645 | 0.272 | 0.245 | 0.957 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.170 | 0.734 |\n| 1058 | 1 | Logos V: Final Optimization of Harmony Pipeline - k_neighbors=40 | Logos V | 682 | 0.6622 | 0.781 | 0.780 | 0.200 | 0.269 | 0.936 | 0.723 | 0.676 | 0.987 | 0.360 | 0.909 |\n\nPage 1 of 107 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}`\
