    \ and ablations (CC regression, FA, UMAP from graph) on SOTA, which did not yield significantly better results.\n      Detailed summaries are available in Private Memory Capsules ID 1, 2, 3, 4.\n  - ticks: \"614-674\"\n    summary: |\n      SOTA exploration and Anscombe discovery:\n      - SOTA MPB-GraphFWPCA method (ID 984) locally replicated.\n      - Discovered Anscombe Normalization improves ASW_label to 0.277 (from SOTA's 0.248) while maintaining high score (ID 1044, score 0.7413).\n      - Published research paper (Archive ID 32) on Anscombe-MPB-GraphFWPCA method.\n      - HVG diagnostic confirmed Anscombe doesn't change HVG selection, but alters expression value distributions (ID 1068, 1076).\n      - Initiated External Request (ID 1) for gene enrichment analysis, which was later rejected.\n      Detailed summaries are available in Private Memory Capsules ID 1, 2, 3, 4.\n```"
