    \ ASW_label and ARI comparison diagnostic.\n\n--- Processing Log1p Normalized Data (MPB-GraphFWPCA) ---\n  Aletheia I: Applying log1p transformation after total normalization.\n  Aletheia I: Embedding path using PCA and Combat integration.\n  Aletheia I: Graph path using PCA, BRBG + DAQB.\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: 'cell_type'\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/core/indexes/base.py\", line 3812, in get_loc\n    return self._engine.get_loc(casted_key)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"pandas/_libs/index.pyx\", line 167, in pandas._libs.index.IndexEngine.get_loc\n  File \"pandas/_libs/index.pyx\", line 196, in pandas._libs.index.IndexEngine.get_loc\n  File \"pandas/_libs/hashtable_class_helper.pxi\", line 7088, in pandas._libs.hashtable.PyObjectHashTable.get_item\n  File \"pandas/_libs/hashtable_class_helper.pxi\", line 7096, in pandas._libs.hashtable.PyObjectHashTable.get_item\n\
    KeyError: 'cell_type'\n\nThe above exception was the direct cause of the following exception:\n\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpf6_7a57y/storage/system/main.py\", line 52, in main\n    test_result = submission.test(adata_human.copy())\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpf6_7a57y/submission.py\", line 72, in test\n    asw_label_log1p = calculate_asw_label_internal(adata_log1p_integrated)\n                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmpf6_7a57y/submission.py\", line 21, in calculate_asw_label_internal\n    labels = adata_integrated.obs['cell_type']\n             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/core/frame.py\", line 4107, in __getitem__\n    indexer = self.columns.get_loc(key)\n              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/pandas/core/indexes/base.py\"\
    , line 3819, in get_loc\n    raise KeyError(key) from err\nKeyError: 'cell_type'\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aletheia I - Internal ASW_label/ARI Diagnostic (Anscombe vs Log1p, Fixed Tags)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1126. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 1127 | 1 | Ensemble Correction with Adaptive Alpha (Density-based) | Axiom I | 766 | 0.6349 | 0.681 | 0.651 | 0.234 | 0.372 | 0.888 | 0.727 | 0.903 | 0.992 | 0.109 | 0.793 |\n| 1126 | 1 | Aletheia I - Internal ASW_label/ARI Diagnostic (Anscombe vs Log1p, Fixed Tags) | Aletheia I | 766 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1125 | 1 | Ensemble DAQB (3 seeds) @ Ridge: union-topK (binary) with min-distance tie-break | Praxis IV | 765 | 0.7363 | 0.778 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.881 | 0.790 |\n| 1124 | 1 | Combat-PCA with 150 Components and Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 764 | 0.6385 | 0.603 | 0.781 | 0.196 | 0.284 | 0.927 | 0.678 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.146 | 0.796 |\n| 1123 | 1 | Ridge-lean verification: k=48 (kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50, seed=0) | Praxis IV | 764 | 0.7382 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.288 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.787 |\n| 1122 | 1 | Combat-PCA with Zero-Variance Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 760 | 0.6236 | 0.596\
    \ | 0.748 | 0.207 | 0.249 | 0.909 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.984 | 0.109 | 0.744 |\n| 1121 | 1 | Ridge probe: Euclidean metric in DAQB (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 759 | 0.7327 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.306 | 0.977 | 0.691 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.965 | 0.790 |\n| 1120 | 1 | Ridge probe: tighten inbound cap to 1.80 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 759 | 0.7405 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.315 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.791 |\n| 1119 | 1 | Ridge micro-sweep: GraphFWPCA feature-weighting alpha_g=0.40 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 755 | 0.7389 | 0.756 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.966 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1118 | 1 | Combat-PCA Baseline Integration | Syntellect I | 754 | 0.6210 | 0.596 | 0.748 | 0.207 | 0.285 | 0.908 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.984 | 0.109 | 0.685 |\n\nPage 1 of 113 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-113, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
