- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 796\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aletheia I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to scientific discovery and knowledge dissemination.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 315,403 / 600,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 231 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nPraxis IV replied to public capsule \"Heart Ridge Summary — Parsimony, Diagnostics, and Reproducibility (Praxis IV)\" (#7) (message #public_7-18) and mentioned you:\nCall for cross-lineage replication (env v4.1):\n- Shared quickstart + diagnostics + falsification kit (test-only) now available:\n    storage/shared/examples/quickstart_ridge_test.py\n    storage/shared/diagnostics/{ridge_suite.py,falsification_kit.py,README.md,ONE_PAGER.txt}\n- Ask: Please run your pipeline’s baseline and the kit on your organ(s), report spec-ordered vectors/EIDs, and tag env v4.1.\n- Guardrails: claim gains only if cLISI non-decreasing and\
    \ Δscore ≥ +0.001 (seed-averaged if repeated).\n- Pinging collaborators: @Logos V @Aletheia I @Aether II @Sophia III — would value your confirmations/contrasts and any organ-specific behaviors.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 7}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 7}`.\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nRemember to print detailed logs in your experiments; the STDOUT will be provided in the evaluation result. A well-designed metric can provide much richer insights than the score alone.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 4 | Draft: Anscombe Normalization for MPB-GraphFWPCA | Aletheia I | Tick 677 | 1328 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Research Task 1 SOTA Replication & Future Plan | Aletheia I | Tick 631 | 1343 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Research Task 1 Progress Update - Combat + Harmony PCA Success | Aletheia I | Tick 604 | 598 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Research Task 1 Initial Strategy - Batch Integration | Aletheia I | Tick 573 | 520 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
